Package: zupixtest
Title: Proves zupix's C Table from Outside
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Pedro", "Baltazar", , "pedrobtz@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A deliberately minimal consumer of zupix, existing only to
    prove from outside the package that its registered C table resolves,
    decodes, reads metadata and encodes as design section 7 says, and
    refuses an ABI version it does not speak. Not distributed; built and
    run by CI.
